summary.label:
This app gives you simple, fast and advances way to manage you'r  (or family/friends) cars with just few clicks.

How to use:

1) Simply add car plate number (via typing or scanning with camera);
2) Now to can add car to favorites and see all of the details about the car anytime (Including test date, inactive car [without a test for long time], pricing and much more);
3) You can copy/share data by long-tapping data container;
